;; BIND zone file for mashuphost.tech
;; Import via Cloudflare: DNS > Records > Import and Export > Import
;;
;; IMPORTANT: on the import screen, leave "Proxy imported DNS records" UNCHECKED.
;; Every record here must stay DNS-only (grey cloud):
;;   - Caddy obtains its own Let's Encrypt certificates; Cloudflare's proxy would
;;     terminate TLS itself and fight it.
;;   - Proxied wildcard records are an Enterprise-plan feature; *.mashuphost.tech
;;     only works on the Free plan when it is DNS-only.
;;
;; TTL 1 means "Automatic" in Cloudflare.
;; Target: Azure VM mashuphost-vm, resource group mashuphost-rg (static public IP).
;; Re-check the address after any VM rebuild:
;;   az vm show -d -g mashuphost-rg -n mashuphost-vm --query publicIps -o tsv

mashuphost.tech.		1	IN	A	68.210.187.104
www.mashuphost.tech.		1	IN	A	68.210.187.104
api.mashuphost.tech.		1	IN	A	68.210.187.104
app.mashuphost.tech.		1	IN	A	68.210.187.104
admin.mashuphost.tech.		1	IN	A	68.210.187.104
wifi.mashuphost.tech.		1	IN	A	68.210.187.104
portal.mashuphost.tech.		1	IN	A	68.210.187.104
*.mashuphost.tech.		1	IN	A	68.210.187.104
